# Local planning notes. Public repo, keep GTM material out of it.
PLAN.md
AUDIT_REPLIES.md
LINKEDIN_LEADGEN.md
COMPETITIVE.md
STRIPE_APP_PLAN.md
VALIDATION.md

# Same rule, and this half was missed: the ledger carries real people's names and
# work emails, and none of them agreed to appear on a public GitHub repo.
growth/pipeline.csv
growth/sequences/
growth/sender.txt

# Channel research, drafted posts, partner and prospect research. Same reason as
# COMPETITIVE.md: it names real firms and real people, and it reads as a playbook
# for competing with RecoverFlow. Fine as private notes, not fine in a public repo.
#
# Deny by default. Listing these one by one is what let the prospect ledger sit on
# the public internet for a week, and every new note written since has landed
# outside the list. Add to the un-ignore below only after reading the whole file.
growth/*.md
!growth/README.md
!growth/icp.md

# Stripe app build output. Regenerated by `stripe apps upload`.
stripe-app/.build/
stripe-app/node_modules/
